      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `messaging_client.py` file, I need to write the necessary code to provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Pub/Sub Messaging. I will use the Google Cloud Pub/Sub service for this task. The code will include the import of the Google Cloud Pub/Sub client library, configuration setup, and helper functions to create and manage Pub/Sub clients. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
